f;font-size:12pt'>5. University students &lt; 25 years</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'> of age</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>6. Contact with infected individuals.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:55.2pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Pneumococcal</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:199.7pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>1. Asplenia.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>2. SCD.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>3. Splenectomy.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>4. HIV.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:55.2pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padd